{"term":{"label":"義","occurrences":6,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"5A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i","title":"萬章上","description":"萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"三","id":"三"},{"form":"主","id":"主"},{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"何","id":"何"},{"form":"告","id":"吿"},{"form":"命","id":"命"},{"form":"喪","id":"喪"},{"form":"孔子","id":"孔子"},{"form":"年","id":"年"},{"form":"既","id":"既"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"聞","id":"聞"},{"form":"臣","id":"臣"},{"form":"至","id":"至"},{"form":"象","id":"象"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.8371272433773522,"source":"主","target":"孔子"},{"weight":1.1884686177899706,"source":"主","target":"人"},{"weight":1.9616585060234524,"source":"主","target":"臣"},{"weight":2.367123614131617,"source":"象","target":"仁"},{"weight":1.807507826196194,"source":"象","target":"至"},{"weight":2.808956366410656,"source":"年","target":"三"},{"weight":3.060270794691562,"source":"年","target":"喪"},{"weight":1.6739764335716716,"source":"年","target":"仁"},{"weight":1.9616585060234524,"source":"年","target":"義"},{"weight":0.4953214372300254,"source":"人","target":"吿"},{"weight":1.5939337258981352,"source":"人","target":"仁"},{"weight":0.6776429940239801,"source":"人","target":"聞"},{"weight":0.6776429940239801,"source":"人","target":"孔子"},{"weight":3.347952867143343,"source":"喪","target":"三"},{"weight":2.2129729343043585,"source":"仁","target":"至"},{"weight":1.9616585060234524,"source":"仁","target":"三"},{"weight":3.060270794691562,"source":"仁","target":"義"},{"weight":1.807507826196194,"source":"至","target":"命"},{"weight":3.060270794691562,"source":"命","target":"既"},{"weight":3.242592351485517,"source":"命","target":"聞"},{"weight":1.9616585060234524,"source":"命","target":"吿"},{"weight":1.6739764335716716,"source":"命","target":"臣"},{"weight":2.6548056865833978,"so